# The Shiftella app as a real tool, the rozpis puzzle and the coach marks (design/handson.md §8, §12, §13).
# English placeholder texts in every language until T9 (see handson_TODO.txt).

# --- bot messages and buttons (§13.4) --------------------------------------------------------------
app.bot.late_alert.action.ask_other
* Ask someone to cover

app.bot.sick_call.action.call_in
* Ask someone to come in

app.bot.sick_call.action.manage
* We'll manage

app.bot.payment_reminder.action.open_money
* Open money & payroll

app.bot.train_delay.action.get_ready
* Get ready

app.bot.train_delay.action.noted
* Noted

app.bot.regular_tonight
* {name} usually comes around {time}. Their seat is free.

app.bot.regular_tonight.action.reserve
* Reserve the seat

app.bot.regular_tonight.action.noted
* Noted

app.bot.regular_to_go
* {name} passes at {time} — to go, fast.

app.bot.regular_to_go.action.remind
* Remind me 5 minutes before

app.bot.regular_to_go.action.noted
* Noted

app.bot.low_stock
* {item} is running low — {n} left.

app.bot.low_stock.action.drone
* Order by drone

app.bot.low_stock.action.menu_off
* Take it off tonight's menu

app.bot.weather_alert
* Downpour from {time} — more guests, wet floors.

app.bot.weather_alert.action.umbrellas
* Put out the umbrella stand

app.bot.weather_alert.action.noted
* Noted

app.bot.cat_waiting
* Someone with whiskers is at the door.

app.bot.cat_waiting.action.look
* Look

app.bot.rozpis_happy
* Everyone's happy with this week's rozpis.

app.bot.rozpis_happy.action.thanks
* Thanks!

app.bot.looks_tired
* {name} looks tired lately. Maybe go easy on the requests?

app.bot.looks_tired.action.noted
* Noted

app.bot.manage_alone
* {name}: "I'll manage."

