# --- digest: helpers' credit and insights (§13.6) ------------------------------------------------------
app.digest.helper_dishes
* {name} washed {n} cups

app.digest.helper_floor
* {name} mopped {n} times

app.digest.helper_register
* {name} took {n} orders

app.digest.helper_bar
* {name} made {n} drinks

app.digest.helper_kitchen
* {name} cooked {n} plates

app.digest.helper_serving
* {name} carried {n} trays

app.insight.busiest_hour
* The busiest hour was {time}. Next {weekday} will probably be similar.

app.insight.wishes
* {n} wishes tonight, {perfect} of them perfect.

app.insight.wish_loved
* {name} loved the {recipe}.

app.insight.unmet_taste
* {n} guests wanted something {taste} — maybe something new in the pantry?

app.insight.coziness
* The hall was {level}; the weakest part: {weakest}.

app.insight.helpers
* {summary}

app.insight.tips
* Tips tonight: {tips}. Best rhythm: {streak} in a row.

app.insight.trust
* {name} trusts the café a little more.

